<view class="page">
  <view class="profile">
    <view class="avatar">🍜</view>
    <view class="profile-body">
      <view class="profile-title">我的</view>
      <view class="profile-sub">收藏与个人数据只属于你</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card info-card">
    <view class="info-title">数据与隐私</view>
    <view class="info-row">
      <view class="info-emoji">🔒</view>
      <view class="info-text">你可以删除本账号的收藏、导入记录、推荐反馈和用户记录。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="info-row">
      <view class="info-emoji">🌐</view>
      <view class="info-text">公开餐厅数据和其他用户数据不会被删除。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="danger-zone">
    <view class="danger-title">危险操作</view>
    <button class="danger-btn" loading="{{deleting}}" disabled="{{deleting}}" bindtap="onDeleteAccount">注销账号并删除个人数据</button>
    <view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="error">{{errorMessage}}</view>
  </view>
</view>
